    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">One example is the expected gradient length (EGL) method [ 57 ], because it can be applied to many learning problems, and the gradient-based optimization algorithms are already used for training learning models</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
