    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">22-2203.13450v3_rag::chunk_012</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BALD represents an irreducible measure of uncertainty.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Various measures of uncertainty exist, and entropy is one of the reasonable measures</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Compared with uncertainty-based measures, the performances of representativeness/diversity-based methods ( KMeans , KCenter and VAAL ) do not show much advantage.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
