    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">stopping AL can be closely related to performance prediction and early stopping.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">stops the active learning process when the classifiers predictions stabilise</hasEvidenceText>
