    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a noisy oracle which nonadversarially provides erroneous labels for some specic classes.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">a noisy oracle which nonadversarially provides erroneous labels for some specic classes. This might occur due to similarities across some classes causing ambiguity for the labeler.</hasEvidenceText>
