    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the most valuable batch from the unlabeled pool is selected using active learning</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Bayesian active learning setup consists of an unlabelled dataset D pool</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In pool-based active learning, accessible unlabeled data are not used for model training in most conventional metho</hasEvidenceText>
