    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">177-2005.07402v1_rag::chunk_002</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">which is called the xed-budget approach. However, there are two problems in this standard approach. (1) Even within the xed budget, it is possible that the learner has enough training data</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">which is called the xed-budget approach. However, there are two problems in this standard approach.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
