    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Conventional data augmentation has been a simple transformation of labeled da</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the algorithm trains the prediction model by utilizing the currently labeled data.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the SVM is retrained on all available labeled observations each time a new data point is added.</hasEvidenceText>
