    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Most existing active learning methods work in a synchronous way, which implies that the label querying can be performed only after the model updating in each iteration.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
