    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">select unlabeled examples that the model cannot classify with certainty. These examples are then labeled, the model is re-trained using them, and the process is repeated.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
